              {
                "scalar": {
                  "kind": "string",
                  "value": "cafe\u0301"
                }
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "comment": "D-16 says labels and names; the same discipline holds for values, which D-14 and D-16 together leave byte-for-byte: a string value keeps whichever normalization form it was written in."
    },
    {
      "name": "document-model/labels/json-writer-keeps-nfc-and-nfd-labels-distinct",
